# Smoke or CO: an alarm goes off. Urgent, so it comes through quiet hours,
# goes to the household when you don't answer ([butler] escalate), and the
# speakers say it in every room. Nothing to close: harness never acts on
# the alarm.
workflow smoke
about When a smoke or CO alarm goes off: says which at once, even at night<smoke speaker words>.
start <smoke starts>
urgent yes
tag no
limits steps 5, days 1

step tell
say Smoke alarm: {input}.
